@startuml
' Moderación de historietas por un administrador (solo web).
' Fuente: modules/story-history (StoryAdminController, StoryAdminService).
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14

actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "LP-MOB web\n(Historietas)" as Web
participant "StoryAdminController\n(/admin/stories)" as Ctrl
participant "StoryAdminService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "StoryGameService" as Game
database "Redis" as Redis
queue "BullMQ story-media" as Queue
participant "Cloudflare Workers AI\n+ S3" as Ext

note over Ctrl: JwtAuthGuard + RolesGuard(ADMIN)

== Consultar ==
Admin -> Web: Abrir Historietas
Web -> Ctrl: GET /admin/stories?visibility&search
Ctrl -> Service: list
Service -> DB: historietas + participantes
Web -> Ctrl: GET /admin/stories/:storyId
Service -> DB: detalle + historial de moderación

== Quitar ==
Admin -> Web: Quitar historieta (motivo y nota)
Web -> Ctrl: POST /admin/stories/:storyId/remove
Ctrl -> Service: remove(storyId, adminId, motivo)
Service -> DB: UPDATE story (solo si PUBLISHED)\n+ INSERT story_moderation_log\n(una transacción)
alt otro admin ya la quitó
  Service --> Ctrl: 409 Conflict
end
Service -> Game: discardFinishedStory(gameId)
Game -> Redis: borra el review en vivo
Ctrl --> Web: detalle actualizado

== Restaurar ==
Admin -> Web: Restaurar
Web -> Ctrl: POST /admin/stories/:storyId/restore
Service -> DB: UPDATE story (solo si REMOVED)\n+ INSERT story_moderation_log

== Regenerar imágenes faltantes ==
Admin -> Web: Regenerar imágenes faltantes
Web -> Ctrl: POST /admin/stories/:storyId/regenerate-images
Service -> Queue: panel-image-regen por viñeta sin imagen
Ctrl --> Web: { queued, orders }
Queue -> Ext: dibujar y guardar imagen
Queue -> DB: UPDATE story_panel.imageKey
Web -> Ctrl: GET detalle (cada 10 s hasta que lleguen)

@enduml
